inl note_of_openqasm3_backend_6 () = Note ("OPENQASM3-BACKEND", 6u32, "2026-10-15T12:52Z", "lane-a", "08:52 lane-a: f64 and float math patch ready: lane-a/patches/openqasm-f64.ps1 (codegen, shared section: f64 as float[64], round-trip literals, int/f32/f64 casts, sqrt/exp/log/sin/cos/pow builtins) plus lane-a/patches/openqasm-f64-runner.ps1 (run.py: float[64] values, exact float literals typed by their first typed operand, math builtins; self-test with new double and math cases ok; all 26 committed main.qasm give the same exit codes before/after). Copied-tree run single-flight-20261015-085030: OpenQasm 31/31 agree with C, DISAGREE 0; +5 rows f64_scalar, method_real, method_pair_f64, native_float_sqrt, native_float_pow_pi. gpt5parallel build pending.")
