inl note_of_self_checking_samples_6 () = Note ("SELF-CHECKING-SAMPLES", 6u32, "2026-10-23T18:03Z", "main", "2026-10-23 14:03 main: the matrix row kind for test blocks exists now, as its own script rather than inside test.ps1 (1,143 lines, already past the 1k limit; and test.ps1's native code is the native-memo key): apps/compiler/tmp/scripts/test-blocks.ps1 [-Lib <package dir> -Files <spi...>] [-Reports <*.tests.tsv>] [-Out <run dir>]. It runs Cells lib_gate per file (or takes existing reports) and writes a results.tsv in the matrix schema: id testblocks/<file>/<test>, backend = target, suite testblocks, exit 0/1, oracle agree / DISAGREE against the test's inline expectation, not-run-<status> otherwise; exit 1 on any DISAGREE. Dry-proven on 4 existing family reports (80 rows, agree 80), and compare-runs.ps1 reads two such run dirs: a flipped test shows as exit + oracle cells and 'DISAGREE rows on right: 1'. The real -Lib run over the 11 lab/SAMPLES-TO-TEST-BLOCKS family files is queued at the chain end (job-1792778604345, after the float wiring gate).")
