inl tibia_offscreen_probes () = Task ("TIBIA-OFFSCREEN-PROBES", "Scripted OTClient probes as the first arena harness, all in C:\\Users\\i574n\\tibia-local (outside the repos): run-offscreen.ps1 starts the client on a separate Windows desktop (CreateDesktop + CreateProcess lpDesktop, nothing visible; window hide from Lua is not enough, the engine re-shows it), muted (enableAudio false in config.otml plus g_sounds.setAudioEnabled(false)); run-probe.ps1 swaps otclientrc.lua with a probe script; probes log to %APPDATA%\\otcr\\otclient\\otclient\\tibia-probe.log; 2026-10-12: probe-summon.lua (GOD: /pos 1932, 1352, 7 then /m green frog,3,,2) and probe-hunt.lua (Knight Sample attacks the nearest monster with chase mode, path-walks with player:autoWalk while refused) killed a green frog: loot 8 christmas tokens, knight 185 -> 10 health (unarmed, 5 frogs); next: port the probe logic to the Spiral headless client and log structured events instead of text; 2026-10-13 06:14 in daily use: run-probe.ps1 / run-policy-scenario.ps1 run policy, measure and step probes off-screen and muted; the scenario script restarts the world, resets the character offline and stops canary at the end", Feature, P1, D4, 100u32, Done, "TIBIA-LOCAL-WORLD", "tibia,client,harness", "current", "current")
