inl default_backend_decision () = Task ("DEFAULT-BACKEND-DECISION", "Pick Spiral's default backend (user 2026-10-06 23:49 'shouldn't rust (or lua) be the default spiral backend? since fsharp have the dotnet boot up time, and not even mrakgr uses it anymore'; ratings were given that night): decide, then change the CLI/Kino default and the docs, keeping F# reachable by flag; decided by the user 2026-10-12 18:44: Zig becomes the default once it runs at C speed (ZIG-HUB-SPEED); F# stays the default until then; 2026-10-13 23:41 user decision: the final default needs CROSS-BACKEND-BENCHMARK with every backend at state of the art; until then the default is the fastest backend that beats F#, preferably not C (C tooling), picked by measurement (compile + run time on the same programs)", TaskKind, P2, D2, 100u32, Done, "CROSS-BACKEND-BENCHMARK", "compiler,backends,decision", "current", "current")
