inl note_of_eoie_spiral_tests_5 () = Note ("EOIE-SPIRAL-TESTS", 5u32, "2026-10-15T03:37Z", "lane-b", "23:37 lane B: planning_cli.rs converted to granular Spiral test blocks (draft tmp/lane-b/eoie-spiral-test/planning_cli.spi, not landed): typed fixture_root nominal, cli_run record, agile_call union (RootThen | ModeThenRoot), one small macro per concern (temp root, state read/write, spawn eoie with tab-split args, contains/count/offset), expect/accepted/rejected in Spiral; both former tests with every assertion are test blocks; run_notebook (Kino copy + scratch host, EOIE_BIN_UNDER_TEST=eoie.exe): 2/2 passed in 41 s; control with 361m/301m expectations: 2/2 failed with 'missing estimate=361m ... in: eoie agile edit ok ... estimate=360m'; macro trap: \\$'*!left == *!right' does not parse (ETY-MissingBody), (&*!left).eq(&*!right) does; next: land it in src/agile_planning_rollup beside planning_rollup.spi, wire a test-block phase into the eoie-dev workflow, then git rm tests/planning_cli.rs")
inl note_of_eoie_spiral_tests_6 () = Note ("EOIE-SPIRAL-TESTS", 6u32, "2026-10-15T04:52Z", "lane-b", "00:52 lane B: LANDED (uncommitted, eoie): src/agile_planning_rollup/planning_cli.spi (both planning_cli.rs tests as granular Spiral test blocks); runner = eoie-dev workflow (src/eoie_dev_model workflow.spi + host.spi, dev.rs regenerated with pack-1f): after cargo test succeeds, every registered notebook (typed registry union rec spiral_test_notebooks: cargo package + path) whose package is selected (or all when no --package) runs through Kino spi/run_notebook.ps1 with EOIE_BIN_UNDER_TEST = the freshly built target/debug/eoie, memo off (results depend on the binary), output target/spiral-tests/*.ipynb; Kino found via EOIE_SPIRAL_KINO, else EOIE_SPIRAL_BUNDLE/../../kino (test-regeneration sets it), else ../spiral/apps/kino; --dry-run prints 'spiral test blocks <path>'; proof: build.ps1 -Test -SkipRelease -Package agile-planning-rollup: cargo tests ok, then spiral-tests 2/2 passed, memo_hits 0; CI (.github/workflows/eoie.yml): checkout i574n/The-Spiral-Language into spiral/deps (Kino cells link |core-), setup-beam OTP 27/Elixir 1.18, mix deps.get in spiral/apps/kino; user: git rm src/agile_planning_rollup/tests/planning_cli.rs once CI is green")
