inl note_of_tibia_gpu_rental_1 () = Note ("TIBIA-GPU-RENTAL", 1u32, "2026-10-21T11:20Z", "tibia-lane", "2026-10-21 07:20 Parked with the Tibia lane's closing pass (TIBIA note 13): Planned -> Paused; resume when TIBIA-AGENT exists and the model ranks policies like live (PR-17 and the TIBIA-EVENT-TIME gaps settled).")
