inl note_of_tibia_gpu_rental_3 () = Note ("TIBIA-GPU-RENTAL", 3u32, "2026-10-22T16:50Z", "tibia-lane", "2026-10-22 12:50 Moved from docs/PLAN.md (TIBIA-DOCS-TO-CODE, rule DC1), the P5 stop rule: no gain over the best baseline after about 300 rented GPU-hours, or a CPU-only agent that plateaus below the scripted cavebot, means stop and re-plan (scenario design or method), not more compute.")
