inl note_of_edition3_280_split_2 () = Note ("EDITION3-280-SPLIT", 2u32, "2026-10-25T03:53Z", "main", "2026-10-24 23:53 main, from x's edition-3 land: the installed formatter's record layout adds X weight. Formatting x's respelled files exploded records to one field per line, and the extra indentation pushed 28 cells past 280 (x-compat and postable gates). x landed spelling only, with a new respell-repo.ps1 -SkipFormat, and keeps formatting under X-FORMAT-CLIENT. Any 280 split plan has to measure weight after the formatter, not before.")
