inl note_of_fiscal_generic_104 () = Note ("FISCAL-GENERIC", 104u32, "2026-10-28T00:31Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-27 20:31 fiscal: HANDOFF set-proof (not launched: waits for no *bench* job on the node; x-nb-bench4 ETA ~20:45). Launch from session scratchpad recgroups/: launch-set-proof.ps1 -Mirror seta -Units 'ubl|nfe' -LibTests, then -Mirror setb -Units '^(?!.*(ubl|nfe))'. Stage now carries cl, my, hu, gr, in/gst, sa/zatca (Samples+Rules), pe/sunat-homologacion; the mirror lib = live (landed 20:17). PASS = every unit + reads_its_documents cell green; census prints zatca + zatca cen invalid counts.")
