inl note_of_eoie_crate_gate_1 () = Note ("EOIE-CRATE-GATE", 1u32, "2026-10-23T10:58Z", "main", "2026-10-23 06:58 main: requested from CRATE-GATE-HARDEN. Reference behaviour is x/scripts/gate.ps1 (entry/output metadata, -Limit, -Enforce, vacuity). It needs repo-wide discovery, because dice keeps its crates in ui/ and contract/. eoie source-topology already counts .rs per crate dir, so the verb can extend it. First users: x (replaces its gate.ps1), dice and alphabet (report-only until their 15-16k-line monoliths are split).")
