inl note_of_banned_words_scan_1 () = Note ("BANNED-WORDS-SCAN", 1u32, "2026-10-24T11:52Z", "main", "2026-10-24 07:52 main: scan done (tracked and untracked; deps, target and _build excluded). spiral has 0 (the compiler rename of 10-18 holds). eoie has the real drift: a package named eoie_cli_harness, which 30+ `*_cli.spi` headers name in `///- --package ../eoie_cli_harness`, plus eoie/standards/census.spi (13), state/bench.spi (4) and lab copies. Decision: fold the rename into KIT-RENAME, since that rename touches every package name anyway (eoie_cli_harness -> kit_cli_runner or similar; eoie team), so names are not renamed twice. tibia has README.md:232 (`live/` \"the live arena harness\") and docs/BENCHMARK.md (8 lines), for the tibia team. Kept: Cargo's `harness = false` (a Cargo key) and the user's own quote \"keep harnessing OTClient\" in three paused tibia titles. Done-item titles in the backlog are history and stay. Still open: the lint rule (word list) goes with GRANULAR-LINT's eoie verb.")
inl note_of_banned_words_scan_2 () = Note ("BANNED-WORDS-SCAN", 2u32, "2026-10-25T23:52Z", "main", "10-25 19:52 main: re-scan with the Grep tool, one call per repo (rg is not on this shell's PATH, so a shell rg loop prints 0 for every repo: a silent false negative, which is why each 'absent' needs a positive control). Found what the 10-24 scan missed: spiral/lab/SPIRAL-CLI-GRANULAR (10-19 files), with 16 uses in rust-check, gleam-check, export-check and reprove-cuda-cpp.ps1 (a \\ variable, harness.rs, Build-Harness) and proven.tsv ('4 harness cases'). Healed: \\, runner.rs, Build-Runner, 'runner cases'; all 4 scripts parse with 0 errors; 0 hits left in the folder (unstaged, for the user's commit). x, fiscal: 0. eoie: eoie_cli_harness is gone (no *_cli.spi header names it any more). Left for KIT-RENAME (eoie source frozen): src/eoie_ci_verdict/verdict.spi:124 (a test message, 'names the harness variable'), FIRST-COMMIT-REVIEW.md:606, and recorded bench and burnin receipt strings in state/ (bench.spi 122/197/221/239, burnin_receipts.spi:9). eoie_predicate_lift/Cargo.toml 'harness = false' is a Cargo key and stays. Backlog hits (agile.spi, 290) are history in done items and notes.")
