inl fiscal_generated_style () = Task ("FISCAL-GENERATED-STYLE", "fiscal generated code style: every _of_string opens with if false then None elif (65 in nfe_v4) instead of a match; union cases are mangled URIs (TTransformURI_http___www_w3_org_...); facet-constrained XSD types are plain string aliases where a nominal with a private constructor (SPIRAL-UNFORGEABLE-WITNESSES) would make the validator the only way in; 17,901 lines over 120 (FISCAL-GENERATOR-FORMATS)", Story, P1, D3, 85u32, Paused, "FISCAL-GENERATOR-FORMATS", "fiscal,codegen,typefeatures", "current", "current")
