inl note_of_x_defuse_links_only_11 () = Note ("X-DEFUSE-LINKS-ONLY", 11u32, "2026-10-26T13:55Z", "x", "2026-10-26 09:55 x: defuse tests on the node (job-1793009220061) GREEN: notebooks tlds and defuse both ok, 0 failed. The drafts (tlds.spi with is_tld over 40 cells, defuse.spi with defused_dots and defused_entities) pass their tests on Rust; next is wiring them into splitter in place of today's every-label.letter rule, after the compiler lane's post-5n gate (a). Size note from the frames investigation: today's rule (posted_unit, inlined into splitter's defused) is the biggest function in the frames crate (225 of 1206 generated lines), because each sm'.index_of inlines to about 12 Rust lines.")
