inl note_of_x_requests_review_2 () = Note ("X-REQUESTS-REVIEW", 2u32, "2026-10-27T11:14Z", "x", "2026-10-27 07:14 x: review pass 1 applied in the tree (unstaged). (a) created_out, deleted_out and session_out were declared identically in requests.spi and write.spi; they now live once in wire.spi next to got, which both open. (b) write's removed re-implemented removal_line's decision (failure, not deleted, deleted); removal_line moved above it, and removed now maps its Ok/Error to the 0/4 exit codes, so single and thread deletes report the same words. Left for pass 2: test coverage of the delete and session paths in requests (create is covered by an_answer_names_root_and_parent and the Bluesky site test).")
